-- To-do 490 (quest 8488 Unexpected Results, Eversong Woods): Gharsul the Remorseless and the two Angershades vanished
-- after a few seconds without kill credit. Cause: Apprentice Mirveda ran the old C++ script npc_apprentice_mirveda, which kept her
-- immune to NPCs (the summons could not fight her) and despawned all summons in Reset() whenever she left combat.
-- Fix: Mirveda gets the SmartAI of the Cataclysm Preservation data (ref_cpp, sniff-based; same summon group 0 as ours):
-- on accept she turns attackable for NPCs (faction 232, immune flag off), summons group 0, casts Fireball in combat, the quest
-- completes when the three summons died (counter set by Gharsul/Angershade on death) and fails when she dies; afterwards
-- she is reset (faction 1604, immune again, gossip back). Our summons already had the ref waypoint/attack rows; only the
-- two "On death - Set counter" rows were missing. event_flags 512 (in Cataclysm TC "while charmed") is a difficulty flag
-- (RAID40) in this core and is set to 0. Gharsul's kill objective still needs the player's kill credit (blizzlike).
-- Source: ref_cpp smart_scripts 15402 / 1540200-1540202 / 15656 id 7 / 15958 id 5; Wowhead quest 8488.
-- Rollback: UPDATE creature_template SET AIName = '', ScriptName = 'npc_apprentice_mirveda' WHERE entry = 15402;
-- DELETE FROM smart_scripts WHERE (entryorguid = 15402 AND source_type = 0) OR (entryorguid IN (1540200,1540201,1540202) AND source_type = 9)
-- OR (entryorguid = 15656 AND source_type = 0 AND id = 7) OR (entryorguid = 15958 AND source_type = 0 AND id = 5);
UPDATE `creature_template` SET `AIName` = 'SmartAI', `ScriptName` = '' WHERE `entry` = 15402;
DELETE FROM `smart_scripts` WHERE (`entryorguid` = 15402 AND `source_type` = 0) OR (`entryorguid` IN (1540200,1540201,1540202) AND `source_type` = 9)
 OR (`entryorguid` = 15656 AND `source_type` = 0 AND `id` = 7) OR (`entryorguid` = 15958 AND `source_type` = 0 AND `id` = 5);
